{"version":1,"key":"article:63","content":{"id":63,"title":"IntersectionObserver","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e0c7a1fa-e1ae-4739-860b-a74092b58a66","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们需要监听某个元素是否出现在视口中，一般做法是监听 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"scroll"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，然后查询元素离视口顶部的距离，但是监听 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"scroll"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件存在性能问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2681a69e-7329-407b-9966-514f7b1bd96c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浏览器原生提供了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"IntersectionObserver"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 监听器，可以监听某个元素是否出现在视口中。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"fc03fc2f-face-414f-8160-4b92e61f4088","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用方法"}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"b2ff0331-0151-4117-8b80-fc0e351b7467","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f814220f-4e21-4e7f-b23e-44396d004147","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"81336752-ca92-43e9-88fa-631f194680d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"new IntersectionObserver(callback, options)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个监视器，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"callback"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是当监听的元素出现在视口时执行的回调函数，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"options"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一些选项，稍后介绍。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9ca5b7db-d96c-40d5-a0cf-de8aafef7fde","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"278be06d-35ac-431c-8c7c-c867635e7406","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后通过监视器的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"observe"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法监听感兴趣的元素。"}]}]}]},{"type":"tabs","tauContract":"0256f72bf503014a7ea32d073aa02da06da7e88c98797870e4d49fa627404693","collabId":"191ba7c1-a510-44b4-a7ed-235f2c52e092","children":[{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"472f54b4-f245-4adf-a29b-2eaeacfb794d","title":"HTML","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","collabId":"0745be7d-31bf-4da9-97dd-b0ca97274362","children":[{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"e33d82e0-d31f-4e74-8eaa-982d30dd3e47","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6eac6ca3-69ad-4a49-92a3-0f5df73b6175","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<div id=\"box\"></div>","collabId":"f8e6a5db-7f13-477b-892c-c52d58d62349","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"ca5f45ad-a5f0-4c75-b3e2-ea7c8e20403b","title":"CSS","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","collabId":"9df76442-4a04-415c-b1fc-6dfab7f6e3af","children":[{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"9ed48f92-87bc-4e02-8415-76591f013213","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"189cd483-cd8e-458d-8ac9-ba7efe3c576f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"#box {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 500px;\n  background: deeppink;\n  position: relative;\n  top: calc(100vh + 100px);\n}","collabId":"cc31b0b